# Files excluded from Vercel deployments (not from git).
#
# Why: these are source-of-truth docs and CI-only files. Nothing in the
# app serves them (yearly reports link to Google Drive; no route reads
# DTCInformation/), and they add ~25MB+ of PDFs to every deployment.
# Videos in public/videos/ are Git-LFS tracked — Vercel does NOT fetch
# LFS objects at build time, so those 404 in production until they are
# migrated to Vercel Blob or another CDN (see docs/VERCEL.md).
DTCInformation/
*.docx
DTC_INNOSpark_Pitch_v2.pdf
.github/
